From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MihaZupan <miha@mihubot.xyz>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 08:09:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] backup: preserve scheduling, retention and
 disappearing-content policies

Port the retained Molly semantic intent directly onto stable Signal 8.34.2.
Source, API, resource and build integration are adapted to this target;
the earlier extraction's unmodified-blob claims do not apply here.

